{"seq":2,"slug":"caching-stale-revalidation","title":"缓存策略与失效重验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/caching-stale-revalidation","wordCount":1428,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存策略与失效重验证\">缓存策略与失效重验证</h1><p>缓存是前端数据请求中回报率最高的优化——一次网络请求的结果被复用 N 次，用户感知到的延迟从数百毫秒降至零。但缓存的真正难题不在于存储，而在于失效：何时认为数据过时、如何在不打断用户的前提下更新、垃圾回收策略如何平衡内存与命中率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Stale-While-Revalidate</strong>：先返回缓存中的过时数据让 UI 即时响应，同时后台发起重验证请求获取最新值</li>\n<li><strong>staleTime vs gcTime</strong>：前者控制&quot;数据保持新鲜的时间&quot;，后者控制&quot;非活跃数据在内存中保留的时间&quot;——两个独立的时间轴</li>\n<li><strong>缓存键设计</strong>：键的粒度决定命中率与失效精度的权衡——过粗导致无关失效，过细导致无法命中</li>\n<li><strong>结构化共享</strong>：缓存更新时深比较新旧数据，仅替换真正变化的引用，避免不必要的组件重渲染</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"stale-while-revalidate-协议\">Stale-While-Revalidate 协议</h2><p>HTTP RFC 5861 定义的 <code>stale-while-revalidate</code> 策略是整个前端数据缓存体系的理论基石。其核心思想用一句话表达：<strong>先给用户看旧数据，同时在后台获取新数据</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant Cache as 缓存层&#10;    participant Server as 服务端&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Cache: 请求数据&#10;    Cache--&gt;&gt;User: 立即返回缓存(stale)&#10;    Cache-&gt;&gt;Server: 后台重验证&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Cache: 新数据&#10;    Cache--&gt;&gt;User: 静默更新 UI\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant Cache as 缓存层\n    participant Server as 服务端\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Cache: 请求数据\n    Cache--&gt;&gt;User: 立即返回缓存(stale)\n    Cache-&gt;&gt;Server: 后台重验证\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Cache: 新数据\n    Cache--&gt;&gt;User: 静默更新 UI</pre><p>这个模型的数学表达为：对于缓存条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 和配置的 staleTime <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，条目在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{fetch} + T_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之前被视为 fresh（新鲜），之后被视为 stale（过时但可用）。当 stale 条目被访问时，立即返回缓存值并触发后台重验证。</p>\n<p>SWR 库的命名直接来源于这个协议。TanStack Query 通过 <code>staleTime</code> 和 <code>gcTime</code> 两个参数实现了更精细的控制。理解这两者的区别是正确配置缓存的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"staletime-vs-gctime-两个时间轴\">staleTime vs gcTime：两个时间轴</h2><p>TanStack Query v5 中（v5 将原来的 <code>cacheTime</code> 重命名为 <code>gcTime</code> 以消除概念混淆）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>到期后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>staleTime</code></td>\n<td>数据保持新鲜的时间</td>\n<td>0（立即过时）</td>\n<td>下次访问触发后台重验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gcTime</code></td>\n<td>非活跃数据保留在内存中的时间</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>从缓存中彻底删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 缓存条目生命周期&#10;    dateFormat X&#10;    axisFormat %s&#10;&#10;    section 状态&#10;    Fresh(新鲜)      :done, 0, 30&#10;    Stale(过时但可用) :active, 30, 300&#10;    Garbage Collected   :crit, 300, 350\">gantt\n    title 缓存条目生命周期\n    dateFormat X\n    axisFormat %s\n\n    section 状态\n    Fresh(新鲜)      :done, 0, 30\n    Stale(过时但可用) :active, 30, 300\n    Garbage Collected   :crit, 300, 350</pre><p><code>staleTime = 0</code>（默认）意味着每次组件挂载都会触发后台请求——但因为有缓存在，用户看到的仍是即时响应。将 <code>staleTime</code> 设为 <code>Infinity</code> 则完全禁用自动重验证，适合极少变化的配置数据。</p>\n<p>一个常见误区是混淆&quot;数据过时&quot;与&quot;数据被删除&quot;：staleTime 过期后数据仍然存在于缓存中，只是下次被访问时会触发重验证。只有 gcTime 过期且没有任何组件在使用该数据时，才会真正从内存中移除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存键设计\">缓存键设计</h2><p>缓存键（cache key）的设计直接决定了缓存的命中率和失效粒度。TanStack Query 使用数组结构的 queryKey，支持深比较：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 粗粒度：整个用户列表共享一个缓存&#10;queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;];&#10;&#10;// 细粒度：每个筛选条件独立缓存&#10;queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;, { role: &#39;admin&#39;, page: 2 }];&#10;&#10;// 层级结构：支持模糊失效&#10;queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;, userId, &#39;posts&#39;];&#10;// invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;] }) 会使所有用户相关缓存失效\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 粗粒度：整个用户列表共享一个缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 细粒度：每个筛选条件独立缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, page: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 层级结构：支持模糊失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ['users'] }) 会使所有用户相关缓存失效</span></span></code></pre></div><p>缓存键设计的核心权衡是粒度（granularity）vs 命中率（hit rate）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效命中率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>缓存命中次数</mtext><mtext>总请求次数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效命中率} = \\frac{\\text{缓存命中次数}}{\\text{总请求次数}} \\times (1 - P_{stale\\_unacceptable})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效命中率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总请求次数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缓存命中次数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>过粗的粒度导致一个局部变更使大量无关缓存失效；过细的粒度导致几乎无法命中缓存。实践中的最佳策略是将变化频率相近的数据归入同一缓存层级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存失效策略\">缓存失效策略</h2><p>缓存失效是计算机科学的两大难题之一（Phil Karlton）。前端数据缓存的失效策略可分为四类：</p>\n<p><strong>基于时间的失效</strong>——最简单但最粗暴，适合变化频率可预测的数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;exchange-rates&#39;],&#10;  queryFn: fetchRates,&#10;  staleTime: 60_000, // 1 分钟内认为新鲜&#10;  refetchInterval: 60_000, // 每分钟主动轮询&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'exchange-rates'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryFn: fetchRates,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  staleTime: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1 分钟内认为新鲜</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  refetchInterval: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每分钟主动轮询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>基于事件的失效</strong>——mutation 完成后精确地使相关查询失效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"useMutation({&#10;  mutationFn: updateUser,&#10;  onSuccess: () =&gt; {&#10;    queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;] });&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useMutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mutationFn: updateUser,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onSuccess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invalidateQueries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>基于标签的失效</strong>——RTK Query 的核心机制，通过声明式标签建立查询与变更之间的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 查询提供标签&#10;getPosts: builder.query({&#10;  providesTags: (result) =&gt; result?.map(({ id }) =&gt; ({ type: &#39;Post&#39;, id })) ?? [],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 变更使标签失效&#10;deletePost: builder.mutation({&#10;  invalidatesTags: (result, error, id) =&gt; [{ type: &#39;Post&#39;, id }],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查询提供标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  providesTags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id })) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 变更使标签失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">deletePost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  invalidatesTags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [{ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Post'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>手动精确更新</strong>——跳过网络请求，直接修改缓存中的数据。这是<a href=\"../advanced-patterns/optimistic-updates\">乐观更新</a>的基础：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"queryClient.setQueryData([&#39;users&#39;, userId], (old) =&gt; ({&#10;  ...old,&#10;  name: newName,&#10;}));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setQueryData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId], (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">old</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">old,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: newName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多窗口与多标签页同步\">多窗口与多标签页同步</h2><p>当用户在多个标签页中操作同一应用时，一个标签页的变更不会自动反映到另一个标签页。前端缓存需要处理这种跨上下文的一致性问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>窗口聚焦重验证</td>\n<td><code>refetchOnWindowFocus</code></td>\n<td>用户切换时</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BroadcastChannel</td>\n<td><code>new BroadcastChannel(&#39;cache-sync&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SharedWorker</td>\n<td>共享缓存实例</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端推送</td>\n<td>WebSocket / SSE</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TanStack Query 和 SWR 默认启用窗口聚焦重验证——这是一个极低成本但覆盖 80% 场景的方案。用户从另一个标签页切回时，过时的查询会自动重新获取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构化共享与渲染优化\">结构化共享与渲染优化</h2><p>缓存更新后，如何避免不必要的组件重渲染？TanStack Query 使用 structural sharing（结构化共享）：将新旧数据进行深比较，仅替换真正变化的引用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 旧数据&#10;const old = {&#10;  users: [&#10;    { id: 1, name: &#39;Alice&#39; },&#10;    { id: 2, name: &#39;Bob&#39; },&#10;  ],&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 新数据（仅 Bob 的名字变了）&#10;const fresh = {&#10;  users: [&#10;    { id: 1, name: &#39;Alice&#39; },&#10;    { id: 2, name: &#39;Robert&#39; },&#10;  ],&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 结构化共享后：old.users[0] === fresh.users[0]（引用相同）&#10;// 仅 users[1] 和 users 数组本身是新引用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> old</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  users: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新数据（仅 Bob 的名字变了）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fresh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  users: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Robert'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 结构化共享后：old.users[0] === fresh.users[0]（引用相同）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 仅 users[1] 和 users 数组本身是新引用</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这意味着使用 <code>select</code> 从查询结果中提取子集时，如果子集未变化，组件不会重渲染——即使整个查询结果发生了更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存持久化\">缓存持久化</h2><p>将内存缓存持久化到 <code>localStorage</code> 或 <code>IndexedDB</code> 可以实现跨会话的即时加载。TanStack Query 提供 <code>persistQueryClient</code> 插件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { persistQueryClient } from &#39;@tanstack/react-query-persist-client&#39;;&#10;import { createSyncStoragePersister } from &#39;@tanstack/query-sync-storage-persister&#39;;&#10;&#10;const persister = createSyncStoragePersister({&#10;  storage: window.localStorage,&#10;});&#10;&#10;persistQueryClient({ queryClient, persister, maxAge: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { persistQueryClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@tanstack/react-query-persist-client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createSyncStoragePersister } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@tanstack/query-sync-storage-persister'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> persister</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSyncStoragePersister</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  storage: window.localStorage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">persistQueryClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ queryClient, persister, maxAge: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>持久化缓存的关键考量是版本兼容性——当 API 响应结构变更时，旧的持久化数据可能导致运行时错误。使用 <code>buster</code> 参数绑定应用版本，版本不匹配时自动丢弃旧缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>缓存策略的核心权衡始终是&quot;新鲜度&quot;与&quot;响应速度&quot;之间的平衡。stale-while-revalidate 模型通过将两者解耦——先快速响应再后台更新——在绝大多数场景中实现了两全。下一篇<a href=\"error-retry-resilience\">错误处理与重试策略</a>将讨论当网络请求本身失败时如何优雅地恢复。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存策略与失效重验证","id":"缓存策略与失效重验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Stale-While-Revalidate 协议","id":"stale-while-revalidate-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"staleTime vs gcTime：两个时间轴","id":"staletime-vs-gctime-两个时间轴"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存键设计","id":"缓存键设计"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存失效策略","id":"缓存失效策略"},{"level":2,"text":"多窗口与多标签页同步","id":"多窗口与多标签页同步"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化共享与渲染优化","id":"结构化共享与渲染优化"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存持久化","id":"缓存持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"请求生命周期与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/fetch-lifecycle-patterns"},"next":{"title":"错误处理与重试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/error-retry-resilience"}}